"                                                                                                        "
"   ALBA   run / check                                                                 ▶ RUNNING   8.4s  "
"                                                                                                        "
"  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━───────────────────────  2/4 complete   ✓ 1 passed   ↯ 1 cached   ○ 1 pending  "
" ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── "
"  HELP / keyboard                                                                                       "
"                                                                                                        "
"    RUN                                                 FIND AND COPY                                   "
"    r           rerun                                   /           search the output                   "
"    f           rerun without the cache                 n  N        next or previous match              "
"    c           cancel the run                          v           select lines to copy                "
"    t           back to the session target              y           copy the selection                  "
"    w           start or stop watching                  s           show stdout, stderr or both         "
"                                                                                                        "
"    MOVE                                                VIEWS                                           "
"    ↑↓  j k     select a beam                           g           dependency graph                    "
"    PgUp PgDn   scroll the output                       ?           this help                           "
"    G           follow the output again                 q           quit                                "
"                                                        Ctrl-C      cancel, or quit when idle           "
"    Copy and graph modes list their own keys in the footer.                                             "
" ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── "
"  Esc close help                                                                                        "
